"text":"For components which are not specified in each ","type":"text"},{"code":"DateComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", but required to specify an absolute date, the base value of the component is assumed.  For example, for an ","type":"text"},{"code":"DateComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with just a ","type":"text"},{"code":"year","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and a ","type":"text"},{"code":"month","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" specified, a ","type":"text"},{"code":"day","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of 1, and an ","type":"text"},{"code":"hour","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"minute","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"second","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"nanosecond","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" of 0 are assumed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Calendrical calculations with unspecified ","type":"text"},{"code":"year","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"year","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" value prior to the start of a calendar are not advised."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For each "},{"code":"DateComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", if its "},{"code":"timeZone","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property is set, that time zone is used for it. If the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"calendar"},{"type":"text","text":" property is set, that is used rather than the receiving calendar, and if both the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"calendar"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"timeZone","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" are set, the "},{"code":"timeZone","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property value overrides the time zone of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"calendar"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/Calendar/component(_:from:)":{"kind":"sym